<title>USA: Franklin Mutual agrees to buy Cityscape options.</title>
<headline>Franklin Mutual agrees to buy Cityscape options.</headline>
<dateline>ELMSFORD, N.Y. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cityscape Financial Corp said Monday that Franklin Mutual Advisers Inc bought the options held by three of Cityscape's principal shareholders.</p>
<p>The options represent the right to buy 4.14 million outstanding shares of Cityscape's common stock.</p>
<p>Cityscape Financial granted certain registration rights to Franklin Mutual Advisers, upon completion of the deal, scheduled to close on January 7, 1997. No further terms were disclosed.</p>
<p>Cityscape Financial, based Elmsford, N.Y., is a consumer finance company.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
